- `SECURITY.md`: how to report a vulnerability privately.
- Biome 2.6.8, like the other ha-* repos (schema and pre-commit).
- Opening a document: the new tab no longer keeps a link back to the Home Assistant page (`opener` cut).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01F4sAn1x21MmgHHeW1MLKJ5
